---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="C.A.S.P.E.R. — Technical Report & Documentation | Mugerwa Elijah"
  description="Central Assistant for Strategic Priorities & Expert Response — Fully local, voice-controlled AI orchestration layer for semantic knowledge management and private RAG."
>
  <div class="py-28 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12">
    
    <!-- Top Navigation / Breadcrumb -->
    <div class="mb-8">
      <a href="/#projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--accent-active)] transition-colors">
        <span>←</span> Back to Featured Projects
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Report Container -->
    <article class="cyber-frame p-6 sm:p-12 space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Report Header -->
      <header class="border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <span class="inline-block font-mono text-[0.7rem] font-bold bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] px-3 py-1 uppercase tracking-wider">
            PROJECT REPORT
          </span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--accent-progress)] font-bold">
            LOCAL-FIRST AI / PRIVACY-FIRST RAG
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight cyber-glitch" data-text="C.A.S.P.E.R.">
          C.A.S.P.E.R.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-mono text-[var(--accent-active)] font-medium">
          Central Assistant for Strategic Priorities &amp; Expert Response
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] font-mono">
          Author: Mugerwa Elijah Williams · Status: Deployed (Homelab / Private Vault)
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Overview -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">01.</span> Overview
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          <strong>C.A.S.P.E.R.</strong> is a fully local, voice‑controlled AI assistant designed to manage and enrich a personal Obsidian knowledge base. It enables users to search notes via natural language, create interlinked folders and notes on demand, automatically groom notes with semantic wikilinks and smart summaries, and receive a daily email brief.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          The system runs entirely on the user’s machine, uses free/open‑source components, and can be controlled from a web interface (Open WebUI) or remotely via WhatsApp. It represents a complete local‑first alternative to cloud AI assistants with <strong>zero recurring subscription costs</strong> and <strong>absolute data confidentiality</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Architecture -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">02.</span> System Architecture
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          The system is built around a central <strong>Flask‑based bridge server</strong> that unifies inference, embedding retrieval, document processing, and remote gateways:
        </p>

        <pre class="astro-code"><code>Obsidian Vault ↔ MCP Bridge (Flask)
                    ├── Ollama (local LLM: gemma3:4b, llama3.2:3b)
                    ├── Sentence‑Transformers (all‑MiniLM‑L6‑v2) for embeddings
                    ├── Langflow (prototyping &amp; scheduled workflows)
                    ├── Open WebUI (local chat interface with slash commands)
                    ├── Pandoc + wkhtmltopdf (PDF generation)
                    ├── Twilio WhatsApp Sandbox + ngrok (remote control)
                    └── Windows Task Scheduler (automated daily brief)</code></pre>

        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          The bridge exposes modular REST endpoints for each capability, allowing multiple front‑ends (Open WebUI, WhatsApp) to call the same underlying orchestration logic. Production logic runs directly inside the bridge for low latency and high reliability.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Key Features -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">03.</span> Key Features &amp; Slash Commands
        </h2>
        
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left font-mono text-xs border-collapse border border-[var(--border-frame)]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] text-[var(--text-primary)] border-b border-[var(--border-frame)]">
                <th class="p-3 border-r border-[var(--border-frame)]">Command</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-r border-[var(--border-frame)]">Function</th>
                <th class="p-3">Description</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[var(--border-subtle)] text-[var(--text-body)]">
              <tr class="hover:bg-[var(--glass-fill)]">
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-[var(--accent-active)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]"><code>/search</code></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]">Vault Q&amp;A</td>
                <td class="p-3">Retrieval‑Augmented Generation (RAG) answers questions strictly using the user’s notes.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[var(--glass-fill)]">
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-[var(--accent-active)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]"><code>/architect</code></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]">Knowledge Creation</td>
                <td class="p-3">Creates folders and graduate‑level, interlinked notes from a natural language prompt.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[var(--glass-fill)]">
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-[var(--accent-active)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]"><code>/groom</code></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]">Note Enrichment</td>
                <td class="p-3">Adds semantic <code>[[wikilinks]]</code> and appends a structured Smart Summary to any note.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[var(--glass-fill)]">
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-[var(--accent-active)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]"><code>/morningbrief</code></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]">Daily Email PDF</td>
                <td class="p-3">Summarises notes modified in the last 24 hours into a styled PDF and delivers it via email.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[var(--glass-fill)]">
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-[var(--accent-active)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]"><code>/reindex</code></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]">Index Rebuild</td>
                <td class="p-3">Rebuilds and re-embeds the vault’s vector index for lightning-fast search queries.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[var(--glass-fill)]">
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-[var(--text-muted)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]"><code>/backup</code> (Planned)</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)]">Cloud Sync</td>
                <td class="p-3">Encrypted automated snapshot and backup of the vault to secondary storage.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technologies Used -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">04.</span> Technologies Used
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
          <div class="p-4 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] space-y-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase block tracking-wider text-sm">AI &amp; Local Inference</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-[var(--text-body)] list-disc pl-4">
              <li><strong>Ollama:</strong> Local model serving runtime</li>
              <li><strong>LLMs:</strong> <code>gemma3:4b</code>, <code>llama3.2:3b</code></li>
              <li><strong>Embeddings:</strong> Sentence-Transformers (<code>all-MiniLM-L6-v2</code>)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] space-y-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase block tracking-wider text-sm">Interface &amp; Remote Access</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-[var(--text-body)] list-disc pl-4">
              <li><strong>Open WebUI:</strong> Local web chat, tool routing &amp; slash commands</li>
              <li><strong>Twilio WhatsApp:</strong> Remote mobile command gateway</li>
              <li><strong>ngrok:</strong> Secure tunnel for webhook ingress</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] space-y-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase block tracking-wider text-sm">Backend &amp; Orchestration</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-[var(--text-body)] list-disc pl-4">
              <li><strong>Flask / Python 3.11+:</strong> Custom REST API bridge</li>
              <li><strong>Langflow:</strong> Visual workflow prototyping</li>
              <li><strong>Batch Scripts:</strong> One-click lifecycle orchestration</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] space-y-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase block tracking-wider text-sm">Knowledge &amp; Publishing</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-[var(--text-body)] list-disc pl-4">
              <li><strong>Obsidian:</strong> Markdown vault with cross-linking</li>
              <li><strong>Pandoc + wkhtmltopdf:</strong> Styled PDF generation</li>
              <li><strong>Task Scheduler:</strong> Automated morning execution</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Implementation Stages -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">05.</span> Implementation Stages
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-active)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase">Stage 1: Core Pipeline &amp; Note Watcher</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Built an automated pipeline (Watcher → Groomer → Director → Publisher → Syncer) that monitors the Obsidian vault for <code>#casper-sync</code>-tagged notes, enriches them with bidirectional wikilinks and structured Smart Summaries, and logs operations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-active)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase">Stage 2: Morning Brief &amp; Email Dispatch</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Developed a routine to collect notes modified across the vault in the preceding 24 hours, generate an executive summary, render a formatted PDF via Pandoc, and dispatch it directly to email on schedule.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-active)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase">Stage 3: Vector RAG &amp; Vault Architect</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Engineered a private RAG pipeline with Sentence-Transformers embeddings and semantic cosine matching. Added the Architect engine to generate comprehensive, graduate-level research folders from single natural language requests.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-active)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase">Stage 4: Open WebUI Integration &amp; Bridge Migration</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Architected a dedicated Flask REST bridge for resilient high-speed execution. Integrated custom tools and slash commands into Open WebUI to invoke backend logic directly.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-active)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase">Stage 5: Remote WhatsApp Gateway &amp; Auto-Start</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Connected the bridge to Twilio's WhatsApp sandbox over ngrok with asynchronous messaging. Packaged the entire local stack into clean start/stop scripts.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-active)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase">Stage 6: Cold-Start Resilience &amp; Maintenance</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
              Implemented pre-flight health checks, Ollama model pre-warming, and index freshness monitoring with <code>/reindex</code> to eliminate first-request timeouts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Challenges Overcome -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">06.</span> Key Challenges &amp; Solutions
        </h2>

        <ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)]">
          <li class="p-3 bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
            <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Bridge Decoupling:</strong> Migrated from pure visual flows to a modular Python Flask bridge for sub-second REST response times and zero pipeline stalls.
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
            <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">PDF Sanitization:</strong> Built regex filters to strip raw YAML frontmatter and sanitize internal Obsidian <code>[[links]]</code> before passing markup to Pandoc and wkhtmltopdf.
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
            <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Async WhatsApp Latency:</strong> Implemented instant HTTP 200 acknowledgments with placeholder status messages followed by asynchronous responses once inference completes.
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
            <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Recursive Vault Traversal:</strong> Upgraded the groomer and indexer to support nested directory structures across deep knowledge trees.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Results & Impact -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">07.</span> Results &amp; Impact
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-mono text-center">
          <div class="p-5 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)]">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-[var(--accent-active)]">$0 / mo</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1 uppercase">Cloud &amp; API Cost</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)]">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-[var(--accent-progress)]">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1 uppercase">Local &amp; Private</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)]">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)]">&lt; 3 mins</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1 uppercase">Topic to Vault Notes</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Future Enhancements -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-active)]">08.</span> Future Roadmap
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] list-disc pl-5">
          <li><code>/studyplan</code> command for automated 7‑day curriculum creation.</li>
          <li>Encrypted OneDrive cloud synchronization and differential backups.</li>
          <li>Hardware scaling to support larger local MoE architectures (e.g. Gemma 4 MoE).</li>
          <li>Dockerized microservice deployment for portable homelab deployment.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer Action -->
      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <a href="/#projects" class="inline-block px-5 py-2.5 bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform shadow-md">
          ← Return to Portfolio
        </a>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)]">
          Generated by C.A.S.P.E.R. Architecture · Mugerwa Elijah
        </span>
      </div>

    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
